@title bit Generations - Digidrive (Japan)
@file Bit Generations Digidrive (J).gba
@game BVHJ
@chip SRAM
@frozen dingbat-bios,mgba,nba
@known * audio differs from both references -- §101 (Digidrive): the three emulators play different random games from the first frames on (the Mersenne Twister's draw count parts at f5, see below), so the game's sounds part; the references meet only where both are quiet or repeat the same sound
# PRESS START > PLAY > SINGLE > START, played hands-off until GAME OVER, then
# RESULT ("NEW HIGH SCORE!!", the height reached) writes the record to SRAM.
# [load]: SINGLE now offers RANKING (on a blank cart it does not), and
# RANKING lists the saved height.
# The menus' backgrounds and the game are random, so the menus are judged
# by their text. Finding: the Mersenne Twister is seeded with 1234 at f4 in
# all three, but the number of draws parts on the first frames (MT index at
# 0x02002584: after f5 dingbat-bios has drawn 1, both references 2; after f6
# dingbat-bios and mgba 2, the second reference 3; at the menu, f1052,
# dingbat-bios 0x435, the second reference 0x437, mgba 0x438), so every
# random picture differs from the title on. Hands-off, the game ends at 3 m
# in dingbat-bios (GAME OVER by f15970), 0 m in the second reference and
# 14 m in mgba, and the three records differ. The second A after RESULT
# leaves dingbat-bios and mgba on the SINGLE screen; the second reference,
# whose RESULT (no new high score) ended sooner, starts another game.

[new]
wait 300
checkpoint warning window=30
press A
wait 500
checkpoint title window=30
press START
wait 120
checkpoint menu window=30 compare=text
press A
wait 180
checkpoint play_menu window=30 compare=text
press A
wait 240
checkpoint single_setup window=30 compare=text
press A
wait 240
checkpoint go window=30 compare=none
wait 2000
wait 4000
wait 6000
wait 2000
wait 3000
checkpoint result window=30 compare=text
press A
wait 180
press A
wait 180
checkpoint after_result window=30 compare=text

[load]
wait 300
press A
wait 500
checkpoint title_loaded window=30
press START
wait 120
checkpoint menu_loaded window=30 compare=text
press A
wait 180
checkpoint play_menu_loaded window=30 compare=text
press A
wait 240
checkpoint single_loaded window=30 compare=none
tap UP times=3 every=20 hold=4
wait 20
press A
wait 180
checkpoint ranking_loaded window=30 compare=text
